{"id":3250,"slug":"3250-template-refs-cach-truy-cap-dom-element-va-child-component-trong-vue-3","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Composition API","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Template refs — cách truy cập DOM element và child component trong Vue 3?","question_en":"Template refs — how to access DOM elements and child components in Vue 3?","answer_vi":"Template ref cho phép truy cập DOM element hoặc component instance trực tiếp:\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { ref, onMounted } from 'vue'\n\n// Ref cho DOM element\nconst inputEl = ref<HTMLInputElement | null>(null)\n\n// Ref cho component instance\nconst modalRef = ref<InstanceType<typeof Modal> | null>(null)\n\nonMounted(() => {\n  inputEl.value?.focus()  // Auto-focus khi mount\n})\n\nfunction openModal() {\n  modalRef.value?.open()  // Gọi method của child component\n}\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <input ref=\"inputEl\" type=\"text\" />\n  <Modal ref=\"modalRef\" />\n</template>\n```\nLưu ý: `ref.value` là `null` trước khi component mount — luôn kiểm tra trong `onMounted` hoặc dùng optional chaining `ref.value?.method()`.","answer_en":"Template refs give direct access to DOM elements or component instances:\n```vue\n<script setup>\nimport { ref, onMounted } from 'vue'\n\nconst inputEl = ref<HTMLInputElement | null>(null)\nconst childRef = ref<InstanceType<typeof ChildComp> | null>(null)\n\nonMounted(() => {\n  inputEl.value?.focus()\n})\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <input ref=\"inputEl\" />\n  <ChildComp ref=\"childRef\" />\n</template>\n```\nPitfall: `ref.value` is `null` before mount — always access inside `onMounted` or use optional chaining `ref.value?.method()`.","answer_html_vi":"<p>Template ref cho phép truy cập DOM element hoặc component instance trực tiếp:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup&gt;\nimport { ref, onMounted } from 'vue'\n\n// Ref cho DOM element\nconst inputEl = ref&lt;HTMLInputElement | null&gt;(null)\n\n// Ref cho component instance\nconst modalRef = ref&lt;InstanceType&lt;typeof Modal&gt; | null&gt;(null)\n\nonMounted(() =&gt; {\n  inputEl.value?.focus()  // Auto-focus khi mount\n})\n\nfunction openModal() {\n  modalRef.value?.open()  // Gọi method của child component\n}\n&lt;/script&gt;\n\n&lt;template&gt;\n  &lt;input ref=&quot;inputEl&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; /&gt;\n  &lt;Modal ref=&quot;modalRef&quot; /&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">setup</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\">\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { ref, onMounted } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Ref cho DOM element</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> inputEl = ref&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">HTMLInputElement</span> | <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Ref cho component instance</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> modalRef = ref&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InstanceType</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Modal</span>&gt; | <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">onMounted</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  inputEl.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">focus</span>()  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Auto-focus khi mount</span>\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">openModal</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  modalRef.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">open</span>()  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Gọi method của child component</span>\n}\n</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ref</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;inputEl&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">Modal</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ref</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;modalRef&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p>Lưu ý: <code>ref.value</code> là <code>null</code> trước khi component mount — luôn kiểm tra trong <code>onMounted</code> hoặc dùng optional chaining <code>ref.value?.method()</code>.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>Template refs give direct access to DOM elements or component instances:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">vue</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup&gt;\nimport { ref, onMounted } from 'vue'\n\nconst inputEl = ref&lt;HTMLInputElement | null&gt;(null)\nconst childRef = ref&lt;InstanceType&lt;typeof ChildComp&gt; | null&gt;(null)\n\nonMounted(() =&gt; {\n  inputEl.value?.focus()\n})\n&lt;/script&gt;\n\n&lt;template&gt;\n  &lt;input ref=&quot;inputEl&quot; /&gt;\n  &lt;ChildComp ref=&quot;childRef&quot; /&gt;\n&lt;/template&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">setup</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\">\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { ref, onMounted } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> inputEl = ref&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">HTMLInputElement</span> | <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> childRef = ref&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InstanceType</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ChildComp</span>&gt; | <span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">onMounted</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  inputEl.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>?.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">focus</span>()\n})\n</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">script</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ref</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;inputEl&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">ChildComp</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ref</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;childRef&quot;</span> /&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">template</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p>Pitfall: <code>ref.value</code> is <code>null</code> before mount — always access inside <code>onMounted</code> or use optional chaining <code>ref.value?.method()</code>.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3213-composable-la-gi-so-sanh-voi-mixins","title":"Composable là gì? So sánh với Mixins?"},{"url":"/q/3214-lifecycle-hooks-trong-composition-api","title":"Lifecycle hooks trong Composition API?"},{"url":"/q/3215-provide-inject-la-gi-khi-nao-dung","title":"`provide` / `inject` là gì? Khi nào dùng?"},{"url":"/q/3216-defineprops-va-defineemits-trong-script-setup","title":"`defineProps` và `defineEmits` trong `<script setup>`?"},{"url":"/q/3200-vue-js-la-gi-khac-react-angular-the-nao","title":"Vue.js là gì? Khác React/Angular thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3201-options-api-vs-composition-api-khac-nhau-gi","title":"Options API vs Composition API — khác nhau gì?"},{"url":"/q/3202-script-setup-la-gi-loi-ich-so-voi-setup-thong-thuong","title":"`<script setup>` là gì? Lợi ích so với `setup()` thông thường?"},{"url":"/q/3204-single-file-component-sfc-la-gi","title":"Single File Component (SFC) là gì?"}]}